/**
 * BRAINROOT — the English edition of BEYİN-KÖKÜ (strings only, keyed by the
 * Turkish original's ids; anything missing falls back to the original).
 *
 * Glossary, kept the same everywhere (the set's code labels already use it):
 *   perde → the veil (a window's perde stays "curtains")
 *   uyum → alignment (uyumsuzluk → misalignment / mismatch)
 *   gerekçe → the reason; gerekçe katmanı → the justification layer
 *   eşleme → sync; yardım protokolü → the help protocol
 *   halka izi → the ring scar; denek → subject; görevli → attendant
 *   Bilişsel Stabilizasyon Merkezi → the Cognitive Stabilisation Centre
 *   "Üç saniye." → "Three seconds."
 * British spelling throughout (Centre, stabilise, canteen, neighbour).
 */
